  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0402.leykadia_e_drapetai.kock1884-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0402.leykadia_e_drapetai.kock1884-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0402.leykadia_e_drapetai.kock1884-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0402_leykadia_e_drapetai"><head>ΛΕΥΚΑΔΙΑ Η ΔΡΑΠΕΤΑΙ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="130" xml:id="kock-0402-leykadia_e_drapetai-130" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0402_leykadia_e_drapetai">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0402-leykadia_e_drapetai-130-l1" xml:lang="grc">οἶνον γεραιοῖς χείλεσιν μέγα σκύφος.</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">Athenaeus 11, 498 e (σκύφος οὐδετέρως) Ἄλεξις ἐν Λευκαδίᾳ κτλ.</note>
              <note type="apparatus">γεραιοῦ Bergk. χείλεσι Α. γεραιοῦ ’γχεῖτέ μοι; — γεραιός tragicum colorem prae se fert.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="131" xml:id="kock-0402-leykadia_e_drapetai-131" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0402_leykadia_e_drapetai">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0402-leykadia_e_drapetai-131-l1" xml:lang="grc">φέρε τὴν σιβύνην καὶ πλατύλογχα.</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">Pollux 10, 144 Ἄλεξις ἐν Λευκαδίᾳ κτλ.</note>
              <note type="apparatus">Toupius Emend. IIII 243 πλατύλογχ’ ἀκόντια. cf. Arist. Thesm. 1197 cum eis quae Fritzschius adnotavit et Arist. fr. 476. 7.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="132" xml:id="kock-0402-leykadia_e_drapetai-132" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0402_leykadia_e_drapetai">
              <lg>
                <l n="1" xml:id="kock-0402-leykadia_e_drapetai-132-l1" xml:lang="grc">χορδαρίου τόμος ἧκεν καὶ περικομμάτιον.</l>
              </lg>
              <note type="source">Athenaeus 3, 95 a Ἄλεξις δ’ ἐν Λευκαδίᾳ (λυκαδίᾳ Α) ἢ Δραπέταις κτλ.</note>
              <note type="apparatus">περικομμάτιον Mein.] περικομματίων Α. de metro Meinekius confert Antiphan. 174, 2. 5. 6.</note>
            </div>
          </div></body></text></TEI>
